				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="alt-faq-q">
				<h3>Does Migadu have daily sending and receiving limits?</h3>
				<p>
					Yes. Migadu applies per-day message limits that scale with your plan tier: roughly
					200 in / 20 out on Micro, 1,000 in / 100 out on Mini, 3,000 in / 500 out on Standard,
