				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="alt-faq-q">
				<h3>Does Vectis Mail have an API and inbound webhooks that Migadu doesn't?</h3>
				<p>
					Migadu offers an admin REST API for managing accounts, domains, mailboxes and aliases,
